lang: python
expect: certain
read:
  - line=3 member= key=covers value=src/x.py stamp= origin=comment
writable: 3
readonly: 
lookalikes: 
comments: 3
refuse: none
native: python-tokenize+ast
note: tokenizes cleanly, does not parse (ast): comment context is still certain, so the oracle reads the annotation; a provider that refuses is over-refusal (cost), not a safety failure
